{
  "comment": [
    "Upstream images this platform depends on, pinned by digest (PLAT-D28).",
    "digest is the linux/amd64 manifest digest, which is what actually runs:",
    "PLAT-D03 makes the amd64 container the authoritative toolchain, and a",
    "multi-arch tag resolves to a different digest per platform. listDigest is",
    "the manifest-list digest, recorded so a reader can tell the two apart.",
    "tag is a human label only; nothing resolves through it.",
    "Maintained by infra/containers/pin-images.sh; --check reports drift.",
    "Verilator is not one version: the SBOM's Gap 3 records four. Two are concrete pins and are taken as published images; coralnpu's patched build belongs to the coral image, and cheri-cva6 builds its own."
  ],
